=2)=_{6}{\\mathrm{C}}_{2}\\left(\\frac{1}{4}\\right)^{2}\\left(\\frac{3}{4}\\right)^{4}=\\frac{15 \\times 81}{4096}=\\frac{1215}{4096}$$","uses":[],"title":""},{"n":6,"text":"이고 $X=2$ 이면 사건 $A$ 가 일어나므로","uses":[],"title":""},{"n":7,"text":"$${\\mathrm{P}}(X=2 \\,|\\,A)=\\frac{1215}{4096}\\div \\frac{65}{128}=\\frac{1215}{2080}=\\frac{243}{416}$$","uses":[],"title":""},{"n":8,"text":"이다. 따라서 $p+q=416+243=659$ 이다.","uses":[],"title":""}],"traps":[],"variants":[],"line":"","note":""}